The marks in this folder come from two sources, both released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

gilbarbara/logos (https://github.com/gilbarbara/logos), commit dafdf2df1334b2327497bfff40111aff0713c992 of 2026-10-17
(its LICENSE.txt is CC0 1.0 Universal): each file as the source draws it, in the brand's own colours, unchanged:
apify-icon.svg, asana-icon.svg, atlassian.svg, aws.svg, brave.svg, chrome.svg, clickup-icon.svg, cloudflare-icon.svg,
elevenlabs-icon.svg, exa-icon.svg, figma.svg, firecrawl-icon.svg, github-icon.svg, gitlab-icon.svg, google-icon.svg,
grafana.svg, heroku-icon.svg, hugging-face-icon.svg, instagram-icon.svg, intercom-icon.svg, linear-icon.svg,
linkedin-icon.svg, mapbox-icon.svg, microsoft-icon.svg, microsoft-onedrive.svg, miro-icon.svg,
model-context-protocol-icon.svg, monday-icon.svg, neon-icon.svg, netlify-icon.svg, notion-icon.svg, perplexity-icon.svg,
playwright.svg, posthog-icon.svg, postman-icon.svg, sentry-icon.svg, slack-icon.svg, supabase-icon.svg, tavily.svg,
todoist-icon.svg, vercel-icon.svg, x.svg.

Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), version 16.35.0: box.svg, stripe.svg, webflow.svg, wix.svg, zapier.svg.
gilbarbara/logos draws these brands as a wordmark alone, too small to read in a tile, so each keeps Simple Icons'
symbol: the icon's path alone, with the brand's colour as the file's fill.

The marks are trademarks of their owners. Dot shows each to identify the service it stands for, and nothing more; its
use implies no endorsement. The owners' brand guidelines, where Simple Icons names them:

